Removing Condo from training lowered retention on Landlord, Mobile Home and Boat, which cut LTV by 3 to 5% on those lines. The drop comes almost entirely from fewer expected renewal years: lifetime premium and lifetime loss both shrink, and the other components move with them. Auto Special is flat overall, and Umbrella goes up slightly, with only a small LTV impact because most of its added premium is offset by added loss. The pattern is the same across agent and call center, so this is a line-level effect of the retrain, not a channel mix shift.
